  "body_html": "<p>통솔자여, 네 부대는 기본적으로 여섯 남짓한 인원이다. 태그 <em>집단</em> 을 가진 추종자 하나로 취급하라. 여기 적는 시작 수치는 모두 플레이 중에 바뀔 수 있다.</p>\n<div class=\"follower-sheet\" data-sheet=\"crew\" data-hp-key=\"crew\" data-label=\"Crew\">\n<h2 id=\"the-crew\">부대</h2>\n<div class=\"fs-stats\"><div class=\"pb-track\"><span class=\"pb-spin\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"crew:max-hp\" data-default=\"6\" value=\"6\" aria-label=\"최대 HP\" autocomplete=\"off\" inputmode=\"numeric\" role=\"spinbutton\" data-spin-min=\"1\" data-spin-max=\"99\" aria-valuemin=\"1\" aria-valuemax=\"99\"><span class=\"pb-spin-btns\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▴</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"-1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▾</button></span></span><span class=\"pb-track-name\">최대 HP</span></div><div class=\"pb-track\"><span class=\"pb-spin\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"crew:armor\" data-default=\"0\" value=\"0\" aria-label=\"방어구\" autocomplete=\"off\" inputmode=\"numeric\" role=\"spinbutton\" data-spin-min=\"0\" data-spin-max=\"9\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"9\"><span class=\"pb-spin-btns\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▴</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"-1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▾</button></span></span><span class=\"pb-track-name\">방어구</span></div><div class=\"pb-track\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"crew:damage\" data-default=\"d6\" value=\"d6\" aria-label=\"피해\" autocomplete=\"off\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-track-name pb-roll\" data-roll-damage=\"d6\" title=\"피해 굴림\">피해</button></div></div><div class=\"fs-hp-mount\"></div>\n<p class=\"fs-gloss\">HP는 각자 6, 방어구는 0, 피해는 d6에서 시작한다.</p>\n<h3 id=\"tags\">태그</h3>\n<p>네 부대는 배경이 부여하는 태그 <em>집단</em> 에 더해, 네가 고르는 태그 2개를 가지고 시작한다.</p>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-picks\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag0\" data-check-id=\"tag0\"> <span><em>궁수</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag1\" data-check-id=\"tag1\"> <span><em>다부짐</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag2\" data-check-id=\"tag2\"> <span><em>용감함</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag3\" data-check-id=\"tag3\"> <span><em>교활함</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag4\" data-check-id=\"tag4\"> <span><em>헌신적</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" checked disabled aria-label=\"처음부터 선택됨\"> <span><em>집단</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag6\" data-check-id=\"tag6\"> <span><em>강건함</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag7\" data-check-id=\"tag7\"> <span><em>위압적</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag8\" data-check-id=\"tag8\"> <span><em>눈썰미</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag9\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag9\" data-check-id=\"tag9\"> <span><em>참을성</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag10\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag10\" data-check-id=\"tag10\"> <span><em>신망 있음</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag11\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag11\" data-check-id=\"tag11\"> <span><em>은밀함</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag12\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag12\" data-check-id=\"tag12\"> <span><em>전사</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tagblank0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tagblank0\" data-check-id=\"tagblank0\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:tagblank0\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"직접 기입\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tagblank1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tagblank1\" data-check-id=\"tagblank1\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:tagblank1\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"직접 기입\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tagblank2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tagblank2\" data-check-id=\"tagblank2\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:tagblank2\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"직접 기입\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-lines\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"exc0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"exc0\" data-check-id=\"exc0\"> <span><em>걸출</em> ('끝까지 영웅' 필요)</span></label></li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"instinct\">본능</h3>\n<p>1개 선택.</p>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-lines\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst0\" data-check-id=\"inst0\"> <span>티격태격 다투고, 파벌 짓고, 앙심을 품는다</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst1\" data-check-id=\"inst1\"> <span>전통과 미신을 고집한다</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst2\" data-check-id=\"inst2\"> <span>저열한 본능에 빠져든다</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst3\" data-check-id=\"inst3\"> <span>남들 위에 군림한다</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst4\" data-check-id=\"inst4\"> <span>쓸데없는 위험을 무릅쓴다</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst5\" data-check-id=\"inst5\"> <span>도를 넘는다</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"instblank0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"instblank0\" data-check-id=\"instblank0\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:instblank0\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"직접 기입\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"cost\">대가</h3>\n<div class=\"fs-row\"><p>1개 선택.</p><div class=\"arcana-track fs-loyalty\" data-check-list=\"crew-loyalty\"><span class=\"track-label\">충성</span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-loyalty-0\" title=\"충성 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-loyalty-0\" data-check-id=\"crew-loyalty-0\" aria-label=\"충성 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-loyalty-1\" title=\"충성 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-loyalty-1\" data-check-id=\"crew-loyalty-1\" aria-label=\"충성 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-loyalty-2\" title=\"충성 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-loyalty-2\" data-check-id=\"crew-loyalty-2\" aria-label=\"충성 3\"></label></span></div></div>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-lines\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost0\" data-check-id=\"cost0\"> <span>다 같이 벌이는 잔치</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost1\" data-check-id=\"cost1\"> <span>공개적인 인정과 존경, 명예</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost2\" data-check-id=\"cost2\"> <span>그들을 돕기 위해 네가 무릅쓰는 위험</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost3\" data-check-id=\"cost3\"> <span>버거운 적을 상대로 거둔 승리</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost4\" data-check-id=\"cost4\"> <span>자신들이나 스톤탑을 위해 얻은 재물</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"costblank0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"costblank0\" data-check-id=\"costblank0\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:costblank0\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"직접 기입\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"inventory\">소지품</h3>\n<p>3 ◇ 이하는 가벼운 짐; 4-6 ◇는 보통 짐; 7-9 ◇는 무거운 짐.</p>\n<ul class=\"fs-inventory\"><li>◇ <strong>손도끼</strong>, 쇠 (<em>근접</em>, <em>투척</em>, x 관통)</li><li>◇ <strong>창</strong>, 쇠 (<em>지근</em>, <em>투척</em>, x 관통)</li><li>◇ <strong>활과 쇠 화살</strong> (<em>근거리</em>, x 관통, ○ 화살 얼마 없음, ○ 화살 다 떨어짐)</li><li>◇◇ <strong>방패</strong> (+1 방어구, 지키기 7+에 방비 +1)</li><li>◇◇ <strong>두꺼운 가죽옷</strong> (방어구 1, <em>따뜻함</em>)</li><li>◇ <strong>망토</strong> (<em>따뜻함</em>)</li><li>◇ <strong>물자</strong> (대원 1인당 4+번영 사용)</li></ul>\n<div class=\"fs-uses\"><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"crew-supplies-a-\"><span class=\"track-label\">물자</span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-0\" title=\"사용 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-0\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-0\" aria-label=\"사용 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-1\" title=\"사용 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-1\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-1\" aria-label=\"사용 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-2\" title=\"사용 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-2\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-2\" aria-label=\"사용 3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-3\" title=\"사용 4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-3\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-3\" aria-label=\"사용 4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-4\" title=\"사용 5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-4\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-4\" aria-label=\"사용 5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-5\" title=\"사용 6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-5\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-5\" aria-label=\"사용 6\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-6\" title=\"사용 7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-6\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-6\" aria-label=\"사용 7\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-7\" title=\"사용 8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-7\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-7\" aria-label=\"사용 8\"></label></span></div><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"crew-supplies-b-\"><span class=\"track-label\"></span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-0\" title=\"사용 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-0\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-0\" aria-label=\"사용 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-1\" title=\"사용 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-1\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-1\" aria-label=\"사용 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-2\" title=\"사용 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-2\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-2\" aria-label=\"사용 3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-3\" title=\"사용 4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-3\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-3\" aria-label=\"사용 4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-4\" title=\"사용 5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-4\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-4\" aria-label=\"사용 5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-5\" title=\"사용 6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-5\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-5\" aria-label=\"사용 6\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-6\" title=\"사용 7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-6\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-6\" aria-label=\"사용 7\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-7\" title=\"사용 8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-7\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-7\" aria-label=\"사용 8\"></label></span></div><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"crew-supplies-c-\"><span class=\"track-label\"></span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-0\" title=\"사용 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-0\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-0\" aria-label=\"사용 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-1\" title=\"사용 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-1\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-1\" aria-label=\"사용 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-2\" title=\"사용 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-2\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-2\" aria-label=\"사용 3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-3\" title=\"사용 4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-3\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-3\" aria-label=\"사용 4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-4\" title=\"사용 5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-4\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-4\" aria-label=\"사용 5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-5\" title=\"사용 6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-5\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-5\" aria-label=\"사용 6\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-6\" title=\"사용 7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-6\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-6\" aria-label=\"사용 7\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-7\" title=\"사용 8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-7\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-c-7\" aria-label=\"사용 8\"></label></span></div></div>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-gear\"><span class=\"fs-label\">기타 장비</span><ul><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear0\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear1\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear2\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear3\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear4\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:gear5\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul></div>\n<h3 id=\"individuals\">대원들</h3>\n<p>누군가 두각을 나타내면 이름과 태그, 특성 한두 가지를 붙여 주어라.</p>\n<div class=\"fs-people\"><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">이름</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind0-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"이름\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">태그</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind0-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"태그\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">특성</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind0-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"특성\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">이름</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind1-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"이름\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">태그</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind1-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"태그\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">특성</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind1-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"특성\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">이름</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind2-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"이름\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">태그</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind2-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"태그\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">특성</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind2-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"특성\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">이름</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind3-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"이름\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">태그</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind3-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"태그\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">특성</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind3-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"특성\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">이름</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind4-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"이름\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">태그</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind4-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"태그\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">특성</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind4-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"특성\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"fs-person\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">이름</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind5-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"이름\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">태그</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind5-tag\" placeholder=\"tag\" aria-label=\"태그\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">특성</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:ind5-traits\" placeholder=\"traits\" aria-label=\"특성\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>이름 예시:</strong> 알레드, 컬후이치, 에이라, 게라트, 글라우, 하리, 로우리, 머빈, 네스타</p>\n<p><strong>태그 예시:</strong> <em>동물 애호가, 덩치 큼, 골목대장, 냉소적, 술고래, 열성적, 노름꾼, 욕심쟁이, 심술궂음, 잘 속음, 뭇사람의 연인, 정직함, 친절함, 음탕함, 몸집 작음, 순진함, 늙음, 인기 많음, 자존심 셈, 신참, 무모함, 뻔뻔함, 날카로운 눈, 다혈질</em></p>\n<p><strong>특성 예시:</strong> ___의 자식/형제자매/부모/사촌/___, 대머리, ___를 짝사랑, ___에게 앙심, ___를 미워함, ___를 우상시함, 농담꾼, 칠칠치 못함, 눈/손가락/손/___ 잃음, 아이들이 그리움, 악몽, 갓 결혼함, 신앙심 깊음, 흉터, 빼빼 마름, 독설가, 노래 부름, 코골이, 허풍쟁이, 지나치게 진지함, 집안 걱정, 휘파람, 나무 깎기 취미</p>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-notes\"><span class=\"fs-label\">메모</span><textarea class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:notes\" rows=\"3\" aria-label=\"메모\"></textarea></div>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"order-followers\">추종자에게 명령하기</h3>\n<p>네가 <strong><em>그들에게 무브를 하라고 지시하고 그들이 그리할</em></strong>때, 그들의 태그가 하나라도 들어맞으면 +능력치 대신 +1로 굴린다( <em>걸출</em>하기까지 하면 +2). 들어맞는 태그가 없으면 +0으로 굴린다. 태그가 오히려 방해가 된다면 불리하게 굴린다.</p>\n<p>그들이 <strong><em>지시 없이 있을</em></strong> 때, 또는 <strong><em>제 뜻대로 움직일</em></strong> 때는, 무엇을 어떻게 하는지 GM이 말한다.</p>\n<h3 id=\"strengthen-your-bond\">유대 다지기</h3>\n<p>네가 <strong><em>그들의 대가를 치르고</em></strong> 근래에 그런 적이 없다면, 그들은 충성 +1을 홀드한다(최대 3).</p>\n<p>충성을 1:1로 소비하여 다음을 시킬 수 있다:</p>\n<ul class=\"bullets\"><li>두려움을 무릅쓰고 네 말대로 하게 한다</li><li>본능/태그/기질대로 움직이려는 것을 참게 한다</li><li>내키지 않는 일을 하게 한다 (끔찍하거나 자살 행위가 아닌 한)</li></ul>"
}
